config BR2_PACKAGE_CHUMBY_APPS
	bool "chumby-apps"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBCHUMBY
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBCURL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_MPG123
	select BR2_PACKAGE_FAAD2
	select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
	select BR2_PACKAGE_AFTER_DARK_TOASTERS	# chumby-toasters' pictures
	help
	  The Chumby One's system apps, on libchumby: Clock (with alarms,
	  rung by chumby-shell), FM Radio (uses /usr/bin/radio from the
	  falconwing-mainline board), AirPlay (what shairport-sync
	  receives; the board selects shairport-sync), Settings, and the
	  stream player chumby-stream (MP3 and AAC streams, HLS, files: for
	  any app, through libchumby's chumby_stream_*). And Flying
	  Toasters, the screen saver chumby-shell starts after a while
	  without a touch.

	  Apps that aren't the system's - Internet Radio, Podcasts - are
	  bundles: chumby-bundled-apps.
